00_AfxulTT7EtaRYu5vgLvRvK4CPVzPNMpDKwxc_t4bH4v1jA&oe=69AEB4E1"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-03.png", "id": "1013963573823261", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_1013963577156594_2061989920474998390_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8VbQc1RTn3oQ7kNvwFpUcCk&_nc_oc=Adm20XQ3p8lmeCVtyEv0kQJNH0-5awGYZUQdjcAZ0wQibEcUH8UQEk6-b-jUB5VYzPg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwJEtkcFuLH8w3dVAA94eTt8AEWszl5DrAJ5mjyjWMWTg&oe=69AEAE96"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "2121495998306034", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982488_2121496001639367_6867377017957057624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=74mlpIi8KvsQ7kNvwEo5ocD&_nc_oc=AdmFOAk3wM_ifckuFRmfihi9RpNP76_Gw7z459ZLr5R1XWbXqz9k5utCxciDW6Qncgg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwi-XAlcN1DHjA3QMeib6AJCKU4qMUo-6jCq1pJVi7Wjw&oe=69AEC8AA"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-01.png", "id": "1186035523063640", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974783_1186035526396973_4771898997726366931_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X_HCvb5jplEQ7kNvwFV-qOd&_nc_oc=AdlTD2sY6RmG36Defy_WP6lzibJz8gMbJZFWuWlOAaIYMvE7vRYC6Njyyu6N2p417Cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfztMjV4TH2dtrgOkpq7wCs0WIg26qBwU0pFDTfYs4cR8Q&oe=69AEA68F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "487841280996149", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031435_487841284329482_7014507726029390394_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tsBLhHJmAhIQ7kNvwExIqQ6&_nc_oc=AdnKgtlwb5T7BFwzcAoj_MqI3QmrsoACGlcvtaYu-7BG1jB386vKibFNdMcN0sP9rBs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxa2H33xBmkdDrUgXUn7imYlhZ4jxigdz8RddSjtoCBbQ&oe=69AEA9F1"}, "display_name": "Squingle", "keywords": ["puzzle", "mr", "puzzling", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.\n\n#  \u2728 100 LEVELS\nLaunching with 100 levels, with more added over time. Levels grow complex, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or fully immersive modes.\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER\nDesigned to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c RELAX & UNWIND\nPlay on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle\u2019s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.\n\n# \ud83c\udfc5 AWARDS\n- Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist\n- Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival\n- \u201cBest of the Quest\u201d ~ Gibby\u2019s Guide\n\n# FEATURES\n- Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.\n- Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!\n- Race your ghost: Beat your best times.\n\n\nGet ready to be Squingled!", "short_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit."}]}, "developer_name": "Dr.